{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118539","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118539/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118539/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118539/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118539","id":4257673675,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79xvHL","number":118539,"title":"Incorrect operation of the sdfgi_use_occlusion flag","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-13T20:28:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T09:05:20Z","closed_at":"2026-06-04T09:05:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.2.stable.official [71f334935]\n\n### System information\n\nlinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn my project, `sdfgi` was previously used. Today I needed to use `sdfgi_use_occlusion` for calculating light collisions, which, as I understand it, works incorrectly.\n\nI think like this: I set true — значит the calculation works.\n\nBut in reality, when I set true — it did not work.\n\nFor it to actually be displayed — it needs to be seen. That is, if I set = true in the code — it will not work in _ready().\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTherefore, I made a small example:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(5).timeout\n\tworldEnvironment.environment.sdfgi_use_occlusion = false\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(5).timeout\n\tworldEnvironment.environment.sdfgi_use_occlusion = true\n```\n\nThere is a delay here — and it works. (waiting 1 frame does not work)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d41cd674-b5b2-4620-b7ff-b93a3b46b1e9\n\nThe video shows:\n- Initially, true is set in the editor\n- In the game, it does not work at all (although sdfgi itself works correctly except for this parameter)\n- After 5 seconds, it turns off — and starts working instead\n- After another 5 seconds, it turns on again — but in fact it already works\n\nThere is also another example:\n\nEnabled in the editor and approached a dark place (does not work):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7fb9537-31c2-4202-9a43-1050b78fecb5\" />\n\nEnabled/disabled manually in the editor in debug mode (works):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9bfd561-b15b-4f25-8a13-f78913e2327a\" />\n\nDisabled in the editor in debug mode (still works):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de69cb74-ed74-430c-bb1d-0592d7cead52\" />\n\nThat is, as I see it, it should have:\n1. Turned on and off normally\n2. Turned on immediately via code (including turning on immediately in the editor)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n--","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0